SUMMARY:Challenging Ride (A) -  EP Marietta 2 (37F)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nAnticipated average pace:
  **18-20 mph**\n\n[https://ridewithgps.com/routes/29400627](https://ridewi
 thgps.com/routes/29400627)\n\n**This is a Challenging (A) level ride and i
 ntended to be a NO DROP RIDE.** The ride leader will ride at the advertise
 d average speed and will do his/her best to keep the group together with r
 egroupings and a sweeper may also be appointed at the start. **Please do n
 ot join this ride if you are not willing to stick with the group.** If mai
 ntaining an 18-20mph average is beyond your current ability level\, please
  consider joining an "Advanced" ride first.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No e
 arbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire lever
 s\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper wai
 ver\, we require an LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this
  ride.\n\nBeing on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. [Join here]
 (https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)
 .\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](
 https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=25714
 8&module_id=323984)\,\n\n[Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpr
 ess.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)\, and [Ri
 de Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318)
