SUMMARY:Impromptu casual D Ride : BI Bird In Hand Long (20F)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide leader: Ann Morris\n
 Sweep: Jon Hartung\n\nImpromptu casual D Ride : BI Bird In Hand Long (20F)
  12-13 mph average.\n\nRoute: https://ridewithgps.com/routes/27049839\n\nC
 ue: https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/wp-content/uploads/cue/BI_Bird_in
 _Hand_Long.pdf\n\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\nThis is a 
 scenic easy route for a nice Friday morning ride (not really "Long"). Pace
  is 13-15\, however you can ride at a pace with which you are comfortable.
 \nPlease be supportive of the other cyclists so that nobody is biking alon
 e or being dropped off the back of the last group.\n**Be Safe. Have Fun. R
 ide Together.**\nHelmets are mandatory. No ear buds. Please bring water an
 d a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nTo e
 liminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membe
 rship and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride.\nBeing on Meetup does not m
 ean you are a club member. [Join here](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/c
 ontent.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\nYour RSVP is your agreement to ab
 ide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/c
 ontent.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) \,\n[Rules of the 
 Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id
 =257148&module_id=325159) \, and [Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.n
 et/docs.ashx?id=454318)
