SUMMARY:CoffeeTue- SN Javateas (21R) -- RSVP required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: Bruce Black\
 nRide Sweep: volunteer to sweep\n\nCoffeeTue rides:\n• A rotating start 
 location\, not a school\n• A predetermined route\n• 25+/- mile routes\
 n• 13 to 15 and 15 to 17 mph average pace\n• Usually no sweep\n• “
 short” stop for refreshment/coffee mid-route at [Javateas](https://javat
 eas.com/)\n\nLike an All Class Ride\, CoffeeTue does not have a single pac
 e.\nThe CoffeeTue rides are social rides\, but cyclists are not expected t
 o stay in one group. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortable paces. Pl
 ease be supportive of the other cyclists to avoid anyone biking alone or b
 eing dropped off the back of the last group.\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and R
 ide Together**\n\nClick for [Ride with GPS](https://routes.lancasterbikecl
 ub.net/cue/sn-javateas-21r/)\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No ear buds. Please
  bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 i
 nflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we requi
 re LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride.\n\nBeing o
 n Meetup does not mean you are a club member. [Join here](https://www.lanc
 asterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\n\nYour RSVP is
  your agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikec
 lub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=32398
 4) \,\n[Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.as
 px?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159) \, and [Ride Waiver](https:
 //lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318)
