SUMMARY:FreeOnFriday? Hike - Welsh Mountain Nature Preserve
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nHike coordinator: Jan Zer
 foss 717-201-0530\n\n\\~3.5 miles. Green connector trail from Welsh Mounta
 in over to the red Cockscomb trail at Money Rocks Country Park and back to
  the yellow trail at Welsh Mountain. Actual distance and route subject to 
 change based on day-of weather and trail conditions.\n\n[Welsh Mountain Na
 ture Preserve](https://www.lancasterconservancy.org/preserves/welsh-mounta
 in/)\n[Alltrails](https://www.alltrails.com/trail/us/pennsylvania/cockscom
 b-welsh-mountian-and-green-connector-trail) We will hike parts of this.\n\
 nThere are toilet facilities in the parking lot at this preserve.\n\nPleas
 e bring your own water and energy snack and first aid kit. I always strong
 ly encourage bringing hiking poles. Please be sure to\nfamiliarize yoursel
 f with the route and terrain to make sure this hike is within your capabil
 ities.\n\nIt is hunting season so please remember to wear blaze orange or 
 some other high viz clothing.\n\nAfter hike coffee/lunch at [Fireside Cafe
 ](https://www.firesidecafe.net) They have counter service. If we are lucky
  the weather will be nice enough to sit outside.\n\nTo eliminate passing a
 round a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup R
 SVP below to join this ride. Being on\nMeetup does not mean you are a club
  member. Join here [Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/conte
 nt.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide
  by the club's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbik
 eclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuid
 ance if an incident occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.n
 et/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3171488
 09/
